[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13443.75, "timestamp": "03:44:03", "text": "魚類。もう魚がいないじゃないか。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13446.63, "timestamp": "03:44:06", "text": "キャンプファイヤーで焼いてください。構築する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13450.5, "timestamp": "03:44:10", "text": "寝室。私はそれら全てを実行しました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13465.11, "timestamp": "03:44:25", "text": "君たちが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13467.11, "timestamp": "03:44:27", "text": "準備完了。ああ、もう寝ていいよ。による"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13471.51, "timestamp": "03:44:31", "text": "その道中、夜が始まった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13475.349, "timestamp": "03:44:35", "text": "うん。ええ、それは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13477.87, "timestamp": "03:44:37", "text": "私が完了しなければならない任務。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13480.269, "timestamp": "03:44:40", "text": "えっと、どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13485.91, "timestamp": "03:44:45", "text": "また寝袋を作るのか？ああ、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13487.67, "timestamp": "03:44:47", "text": "B. それから、レシピはありますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13489.269, "timestamp": "03:44:49", "text": "それ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13492.51, "timestamp": "03:44:52", "text": "ああ、わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13496.87, "timestamp": "03:44:56", "text": "キャンプファイヤー、基本的な建築キット、廊下、"}]